<p>Concentrate on your blows; for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 5, 6, 6, 7</acronym> turns, each strike you land on your target in melee range has a <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Dexterity 100">41%, 49%, 54%, 58%, 61%</acronym> chance to trigger another, similar strike.</p><p>This works for all blows, even those from other talents and from shield bashes, but you can gain no more than one extra blow with each weapon during a turn.</p><p>The chance increases with your Dexterity.</p>